 "library": {
  "title": "SWAT soldier (animated) 1.8 m",
  "description": "An ANIMATED tactical officer for games: the Quaternius SWAT character (CC0) imported with its skeleton (62 bones) and 24 clips (Idle_Gun, Run_Shoot, Gun_Shoot, Death...), wearing gear modelled in KherveCAD \u2014 plate carrier with MOLLE rows, magazine pouches, radio and antenna, grenade, duty belt and holster, knee and elbow pads, hydration pack, patches, helmet NVG mount, rails and headset \u2014 each part in a Bone node riding on its bone (Chest, Torso, Head, arms...). 1800 mm tall, z = 0 floor, facing -Y. pose_character previews any clip; export_character writes the animated GLB (KherveOS Rune Keep uses it as soldier-cad.glb).",
